Chapter D: Minimum sumset size
D.1: Unrestricted sumsets:
ρ(G, m, h ) = min {|hA| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρ(G, m, [0, s ]) = min {|[0, s ]A| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρ(G, m, N0) = min {|⟨A⟩| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
D.2: Unrestricted signed sumsets:
ρ± (G, m, h ) = min {|h± A| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρ± (G, m, [0, s ]) = min {|[0, s ]± A| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρ± (G, m, N0) = min {|⟨A⟩| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}

D.3: Restricted sumsets:
ρˆ (G, m, h ) = min {|hˆA| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρˆ (G, m, [0, s ]) = min {|[0, s ] ˆA| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρˆ (G, m, N0) = min {|ΣA| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
D.4: Restricted signed sumsets:
ρ ˆ± (G, m, h ) = min {|hˆ± A| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρ ˆ± (G, m, [0, s ]) = min {|[0, s ]ˆ± A| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
ρ ˆ± (G, m, N0) = min {|Σ± A| |A ⊆ G, |A|= m}
